    "7.4": "Use explicit helpful feedback on attributed contributions; do not implement 2.6 freshness or 7.3 post-visit prompting as prerequisites.",
    "R4": "Weekly outing memories is Must under the everything-else rule; it still needs a spec, privacy tests and an opt-in shared-content contract.",
